<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0678_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ernest</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You got some NERVE!\nThat’s hard!\fJust what I look for in a homie!\rWhadda ya say we swap\nnumbers and be best homies? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight!\nCall me anytime!\rAbout school,\nor about homies,\for a puzzle,\for a Block trick.\fEven if nothin’ hard come up,\fyou can still gimme a call!\rI prob’ly won’t know the answer, but\nI’ll at least listen!\r’Cause we homies, you know?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! What, you nervous?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, I see you finally figured out\nhow amazin’ I’m?\rWell, that’s expected. Let’s\nswap numbers! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Well, I prob’ly look way scarier than\nI’m. Would you believe I’m deadass\fa nice guy?\rI won’t bite, so come talk to me\nin person!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo, Teddy! You do a pretty good\nmotorcycle impression!\rNext time you get a chance, you and me\nshould go ridin’ and yell like\fmotorcycles. What you say?\r......Wait, who is this?\rOh no! Wrong number!\nMy bad!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} go HARD!\nAnyway, its fightin’ spirit different.\rIt ain’t never lost to nothin’ but the\nstrongest homies!\rWhat about your homies?\nThey got any fightin’ spirit?\rNever mind, you ain’t gotta answer.\rI know better than anybody\nhow strong your homies is!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We a Biker gang, you know.\nGot homies with poison,\fwith spikes all over their bodies,\fwith fangs, and we even got some\fGhost-type homies.\fIt’s all a show of how tough we.\rBut...\rAs for me...\rI REALLY like cute homies like MARILL!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So, yesterday I thought I was finna\ncatch a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}.\fBut that {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}, it took one look\fat me and dipped!\rIt was SO rude!\rYou wouldn’t run if you saw me,\nwould you...?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo! I REALLY wanna scrap you again.\nI mean, I’m itchin’ to show off!\rI’m always hangin’ on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}. Don’t get all\fnervous and dip, got it?!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What’s goin’ on with you?\nI’m waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!\rYou wouldn’t forget a promise you made\nwith a homie, would you?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, my bro Markey was talkin’\nabout this earlier... You thought\fabout joinin’ our crew at all?\rWe hang on Cycling Road and make a\nLOT of noise, throw trash around,\fthen pick up our trash and take it\fhome to throw away. It’s SO fun!</language>
	</row>
</body>
